    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Claire a la Mode</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend or go it alone on a sugar-high adventure in <i><strong>Claire a la Mode</strong></i>! Bake your dessert masterpiece and collect new bakers as you rise through a high-stakes bake-off full of cheaters. Fend off their decadent lackeys and against all odds, come out on top in a worldwide baking frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/da50260939566d6c6adabff6e0af9719.poster.avif?t=1755011772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/da50260939566d6c6adabff6e0af9719.webm?t=1755011772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/da50260939566d6c6adabff6e0af9719.mp4?t=1755011772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DASH</strong> your way through each stage of a worldwide bake-off, either on your own or with a friend in couch co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEAT</strong> Queen Bee and stop her lackeys from rigging the competition and buying out the rest of the city through the missions of three unique campaigns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REPLAY </strong>as different characters to beat your high score and experience everything the game has to offer - from collectables and secrets, to stories and unlockable characters! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features that <i>Claire a la Mode</i>\u00a0has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ Unique playable characters with their own strengths and weaknesses that change how you approach each level</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking chaos in each stage as you prepare your cake for the judges to win it all despite interference and danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Co-op craziness to help or hinder your pals on your way to take down the cheaters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible OST filled with all of the colorful sounds of <i>Claire a la Mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, snappy, arcadey fun (NO QUARTERS REQUIRED)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once in a lifetime opportunity for an experience full of baking delight!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/2e4eaf204ed5e886059270d3b230dc1b.avif?t=1755011772\" data-has-big /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Claire a la Mode</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend or go it alone on a sugar-high adventure in <i><strong>Claire a la Mode</strong></i>! Bake your dessert masterpiece and collect new bakers as you rise through a high-stakes bake-off full of cheaters. Fend off their decadent lackeys and against all odds, come out on top in a worldwide baking frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/da50260939566d6c6adabff6e0af9719.poster.avif?t=1755011772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/da50260939566d6c6adabff6e0af9719.webm?t=1755011772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/da50260939566d6c6adabff6e0af9719.mp4?t=1755011772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DASH</strong> your way through each stage of a worldwide bake-off, either on your own or with a friend in couch co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEAT</strong> Queen Bee and stop her lackeys from rigging the competition and buying out the rest of the city through the missions of three unique campaigns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REPLAY </strong>as different characters to beat your high score and experience everything the game has to offer - from collectables and secrets, to stories and unlockable characters! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features that <i>Claire a la Mode</i>\u00a0has to offer:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7+ Unique playable characters with their own strengths and weaknesses that change how you approach each level</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking chaos in each stage as you prepare your cake for the judges to win it all despite interference and danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Co-op craziness to help or hinder your pals on your way to take down the cheaters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible OST filled with all of the colorful sounds of <i>Claire a la Mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, snappy, arcadey fun (NO QUARTERS REQUIRED)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once in a lifetime opportunity for an experience full of baking delight!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292860/extras/2e4eaf204ed5e886059270d3b230dc1b.avif?t=1755011772\" data-has-big /></span></p></li></ul>",
